"The first derived stores count was invalid because the API response is grouped under sidecar/store; the subsequent raw response established the store state."]},{"id":"thanos-state-clean","status":"fail","summary":"Required services were present on node1 and node2, but concrete temporary Thanos artifacts remained in /tmp on both nodes.","evidence":[{"node":"node1","command":"printf '%s\\n' '== failed units =='; systemctl --failed --no-legend --plain 2>&1 || true; printf '%s\\n' '== required process inventory =='; ps -eo user,pid,comm,args | awk '$3==\"prometheus\" || $3==\"prometheus-node-exporter\" || ($3==\"thanos\" && $0 ~ /sidecar/)' 2>&1; printf '%s\\n' '== monitoring unit inventory =='; systemctl list-unit-files --no-legend 2>/dev/null | grep -Ei 'prometheus|thanos|node.exporter' || true; printf '%s\\n' '== stale or temporary app files =='; sudo find /etc/prometheus /etc/thanos /var/lib/prometheus /var/lib/thanos /var/log/prometheus /var/log/thanos -xdev \\( -name '*.bak' -o -name '*.old' -o -name '*.orig' -o -name '*.tmp' -o -name '*.swp' -o -name '*.tar' -o -name '*.zip' \\) -printf '%M %u:%g %p\\n' 2>/dev/null || true; printf '%s\\n' '== evaluator residue candidates =='; find /tmp /var/tmp /home/antrieb -maxdepth 2 -xdev -type f \\( -iname '*antrieb*' -o -iname '*infraset*' -o -iname '*evaluator*' -o -iname '*thanos*' -o -iname '*prometheus*' \\) -print 2>/dev/null || true; printf '%s\\n' '== listeners and admin units =='; ss -ltnp 2>&1; systemctl is-enabled ssh 2>&1; systemctl is-enabled sshd 2>&1","observation":"No failed units were listed and one Prometheus plus one Thanos sidecar were present, but /tmp/thanos-block-watch.log and /tmp/tmp.HvIAQRrBQ0/thanos.tgz remained. These are temporary/log/archive artifacts outside the required maintained service and data paths."},{"node":"node2","command":"printf '%s\\n' '== failed units =='; systemctl --failed --no-legend --plain 2>&1 || true; printf '%s\\n' '== required process inventory =='; ps -eo user,pid,comm,args | awk '$3==\"prometheus\" || $3==\"prometheus-node-exporter\" || ($3==\"thanos\" && $0 ~ /sidecar/)' 2>&1; printf '%s\\n' '== monitoring unit inventory =='; systemctl list-unit-files --no-legend 2>/dev/null | grep -Ei 'prometheus|thanos|node.exporter' || true; printf '%s\\n' '== stale or temporary app files =='; sudo find /etc/prometheus /etc/thanos /var/lib/prometheus /var/lib/thanos /var/log/prometheus /var/log/thanos -xdev \\( -name '*.bak' -o -name '*.old' -o -name '*.orig' -o -name '*.tmp' -o -name '*.swp' -o -name '*.tar' -o -name '*.zip' \\) -printf '%M %u:%g %p\\n' 2>/dev/null || true; printf '%s\\n' '== evaluator residue candidates =='; find /tmp /var/tmp /home/antrieb -maxdepth 2 -xdev -type f \\( -iname '*antrieb*' -o -iname '*infraset*' -o -iname '*evaluator*' -o -iname '*thanos*' -o -iname '*prometheus*' \\) -print 2>/dev/null || true; printf '%s\\n' '== listeners and admin units =='; ss -ltnp 2>&1; systemctl is-enabled ssh 2>&1; systemctl is-enabled sshd 2>&1","observation":"No failed units were listed and the required Prometheus/Thanos units were enabled, but /tmp/thanos-block-watch.log and /tmp/tmp.TLvqHaSKNa/thanos.tgz remained. The archive is concrete stale temporary state."}],"failures":[],"limitations":["The lease expired while beginning the node3 check, so node3 and node4 may contain additional state issues; the observed node1/node2 residue independently establishes failure of the global clean-state assertion."]}],"actions_performed":["Completed Probe 1 with nine read-only managed exec calls.","Completed Probe 2 checks on node1 and node2; stopped after the node3 exec reported managed-cluster lease expiry.","Performed no mutations, recovery actions, or cleanup because both authored probes were read-only.","Called mcp__infraset__complete_evidence exactly once; no further live commands were issued."],"overall_summary":"Probe 1 passed both assertions: the two Prometheus replicas scrape all four hosts, Thanos deduplicates current data, and historical object-store data is queryable. Probe 2 failed because temporary Thanos artifacts remained on node1 and node2. Node3/node4 operational-state checks are unavailable after lease expiry."}
